  id: 57
  missionName: THE PRISONER
  missionType: INVESTIGATION
  briefing: Renzo wakes on the temple floor with Nire beside him. The prison wing
    is below them. Aiko was held there for years, and the wardens were told to let
    no one read the walls.
  debrief: Renzo reads his sister's handwriting for the first time in ten years.
